Z||000000||BBBAD GT||07-28-2000||11:28 AM||||Just came to terms with Chris McDonald's V8 Fiero he had for sale.  He's really a nice guy, and a total car freak. We spent waaaay too much time on the phone just talking cars in general.  Will hopefully pick it up in a couple weeks.  <P>I feel a little funny buying a car that is basically done.  I like building them up (as most of you do) and being proud of my handywork, but I will be just as proud of what Chris did.  <P>Thanks to all I've bugged in the past 3 weeks asking about V8 Fieros and other things(you know who you are).<P>Here are some pics:<P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/fiero1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Side-Rear View</A><BR> <A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/fiero2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>350 Motor</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/fiero3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Rear Exhaust View</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/fiero4.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Side View</A><P><BR>I'm going to have to change my nick........<BR> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">  <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><BR><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||12
