Z||000015||BBBAD GT||07-30-2000||01:13 AM||||How about this wing?<P> <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=395270415" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=395270415</A> <P>Just kidding   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Actually, I told the wife if I ever get something like that...to shoot me dead.  I found this 85 on Ebay, its a 4 banger if anybody is interested.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">   <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><BR><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A><p>[This message has been edited by BBBAD GT (edited 07-30-2000).]||||reg||12
