Z||000030||RiceCooker||07-31-2000||02:34 PM||||I usually go for the wing look but this is different, i can't explain it. It just looks so sweet, you dont want to fix it if it aint't broken.<P>By the way, are your blades 17"'s? They look a little bigger than my 16's. I first saw them on Archie's blue chop top and i knew i had to get them. Too bad they discontinued them eh?||||reg||1
Z||000031||RiceCooker||07-31-2000||02:34 PM||||I usually go for the wing look but this is different, i can't explain it. It just looks so sweet, you dont want to fix it if it aint't broken.<P>By the way, are your blades 17"'s? They look a little bigger than my 16's. I first saw them on Archie's blue chop top and i knew i had to get them. Too bad they discontinued them eh?||||reg||1
Z||000032||BBBAD GT||07-31-2000||05:47 PM||||Yes, they are 17" blades, 17x7.5 to be exact.  I'm not sure about them being discountinued, but I did see them still on the discounttiredirect.com web page(I think $204 ea, *ouch*).  The tire size on the car is 215/40-17 front, 235/45-17 back. <P>Oh, kidding around, I did ask Chris where the space saver spare was (the battery up front takes up all the space), and he said the stock 15" spare wouldn't clear the 11" brakes.  Darn.  (hehe)<P> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">  <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><BR><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
